   "question": "Will NVIDIA have completed its agreed acquisition of Hugging Face by 28 February 2027, as established by its completion announcement, Form 8-K or quarterly or annual filings?",
   "object": "NVDA",
   "not_judged": [
    {
     "part": "The approximately $12.9 billion purchase price and whether the acquisition is repriced.",
     "why": "Completion is the tracked event, so a completed acquisition counts regardless of a change in price."
