   "period": "Calendar year 2026 — the item's present-tense annual pace in a 30 September 2026 article; checked against full-year 2026 grid-operator/interconnection and industry data-center capacity data (expected early 2027).",
   "settled_by": "Grid operators' and utilities' large-load interconnection and capacity data, EIA electric power data, and the semi-annual industry data-center capacity reports (e.g., CBRE/JLL North America Data Center Trends, Dell'Oro) covering calendar 2026."
