n its maximum potential dollar exposure."}], "event": null, "figure": {"unit": "USD", "year": "FY2027", "ranges": [{"lo": null, "hi": "1000000000"}, {"lo": "1000000000", "hi": "5000000000"}, {"lo": "5000000000", "hi": "10000000000"}, {"lo": "10000000000", "hi": "20000000000"}, {"lo": "20000000000", "hi": null}], "favourable_end": "lower", "favourable_why": "Lower maximum loss coverage limits Nvidia's contingent financial exposure, while the item describes both demand support and guarantee risk without establishing that greater exposure is preferable."}, "reference": null, "due_day": "2027-02-28", "due_day_basis": "expected_publication"}, "passage": null}
