ribes the product's background and is not the tracked shipment milestone."}], "event": {"happened": "Nvidia's fiscal Q3 FY2027 report or earnings call, or a shipment disclosure from Nvidia or a system partner available by November 30, 2026, confirms that Groq 3 LPX volume shipments began during fiscal Q3 FY2027; full production, orders, or samples alone do not qualify.", "ruled_out": {"by_whom": "Nvidia", "decision": "After October 8, 2026, and by November 30, 2026, Nvidia formally cancels the Groq 3 LPX launch or decides to defer all initial volume shipments until after fiscal Q3 FY2027."}}, "figure": null, "reference": {"words": "volume shipments expected later this quarter", "kind": "expected", "value": null, "value_to": null}, "due_day": "2026-11-30", "due_day_basis": "stated"}, "passage": "volume shipments expected later this quarter"}
