{"i": 10, "t": {"description": "Will Nvidia complete its approximately $12.93 billion acquisition of Hugging Face — and at what final cost and regulatory conditions — by the check date?", "outcome": "Closing or termination of the signed Hugging Face acquisition, the final consideration paid (roughly $11.9 billion to shareholders plus up to $1 billion of equity-based retention awards), and any conditions regulators impose.", "period": "Check date: the first half of calendar 2027, the closing window the Sept. 3, 2026 agreement states (within 18 months of the Oct. 6, 2026 item).", "settled_by": "Nvidia's closing announcement and the regulatory (antitrust and any foreign-investment) clearance decisions, plus the purchase accounting and cash outflow disclosed in Nvidia's subsequent quarterly and annual filings."}, "q": "Will Nvidia complete its acquisition of Hugging Face by June 30, 2027, as confirmed by Nvidia's closing announcement or regulatory filings?", "n": ["The final acquisition cost versus approximately $12.93 billion.", "Approximately $11.9 billion payable to Hugging Face shareholders.", "Up to $1 billion of equity-based employee retention awards.", "Any conditions imposed by antitrust or foreign-investment regulators."], "e": {"happened": "Nvidia completes the acquisition of Hugging Face on or before June 30, 2027, as confirmed by its closing announcement or regulatory filings.", "ruled_out": {"by_whom": "Nvidia, Hugging Face, a competent antitrust or foreign-investment authority, or a court with jurisdiction", "decision": "After October 6, 2026, Nvidia or Hugging Face formally terminates or abandons the acquisition, or a competent antitrust or foreign-investment authority or court issues a definitive decision prohibiting the acquisition as a whole."}}, "f": null, "d": "2027-06-30", "p": "The closing of the transaction is subject to customary conditions and regulatory approvals and is anticipated to occur in the first half of 2027."}
{"i": 11, "t": {"description": "How much residual-value/loss-share exposure has Nvidia taken on under its customer data center financing support — the commitment to cover up to 25% of the loss if financed chips lose value — and how much is disclosed at its next annual report?", "outcome": "The maximum potential amount of Nvidia's loss coverage on customer data center chip values, any amounts paid or accrued, and the terms and remaining duration of that support, as disclosed in Nvidia's next annual report.", "period": "Nvidia's next annual report (fiscal year ending late January 2027), as fixed by the reason for an obligation already undertaken.", "settled_by": "Nvidia's next annual report (Form 10-K), including its guarantees and contingent-liability note and any related customer-financing disclosures."}, "q": "What is Nvidia's maximum potential loss-coverage obligation, in USD, under its customer data center chip-value financing support at FY2027 year-end, as disclosed in its FY2027 Form 10-K guarantees, contingent-liability and related customer-financing disclosures?", "n": ["Amounts paid under the support", "Amounts accrued under the support", "The commitment to cover up to 25% of losses", "Other terms of the support", "Remaining duration of the support"], "e": null, "f": {"unit": "USD", "year": "FY2027", "ranges": [{"lo": null, "hi": "1000000000"}, {"lo": "1000000000", "hi": "5000000000"}, {"lo": "5000000000", "hi": "10000000000"}, {"lo": "10000000000", "hi": "20000000000"}, {"lo": "20000000000", "hi": null}], "favourable_end": "lower", "favourable_why": "A lower maximum obligation limits Nvidia's potential losses from customer-financing support, whose demand benefits and financial risks the item both describe."}, "d": "2027-02-28", "p": null}
