000000000"}, {"lo": "50000000000", "hi": null}], "favourable_end": "lower", "favourable_why": "Lower obligations reduce NVIDIA's contingent financial exposure to customer-backed demand, while the item does not establish that the benefits of greater support outweigh its risks."}, "d": "2027-02-28", "p": null}
